{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621860/extras/Summary.png?t=1743798841\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>RAIN;CHECK</strong> tells a short story set in a small town in the middle of a rainy night about a girl just trying to get by in this world. During this special night, the most unexpected happens, and a storm of events brews ever closer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose how Maria deals with the impending threat in this Visual Novel by Studio Meow Meow Meadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621860/extras/Features.png?t=1743798841\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple Endings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stylized Art.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Static and Animated CGs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Introspective cows.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bonus Game inside the Game, the contents of which, unidentified to this day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621860/extras/mystery.gif?t=1743798841\" /></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>What could it be?</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3621860?t=1743798841","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3621860?t=1743798841","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621860/02a70b6dad797ebd778f81b0d2d0562a3c9c0fd7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743798841","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621860/02a70b6dad797ebd778f81b0d2d0562a3c9c0fd7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743798841","categories":[{"description":"Single-pl